   "text": "The '99.99% fusion traffic reduction' compares 16.7M counterfactual wavelets\nfor the eliminated 32 MiB intermediate against 2,048 wavelets from a 32x32x32\ntoy matmul. The unfused baseline assumes that intermediate crosses the fabric.\nIt is a definition, not a measurement.",
